We are filing a cargo damage claim for the shipment that left Gdynia on 25 Se=
p and was discharged in Rotterdam on 28 Sep (container MSKU4471826, delivery =
80412257, PO 4500318842). On opening the container this morning, the receivin=
g team found 14 of 22 pallets of electronics wet. Cartons are soaked at the b=
ottom and sides, and several have mould spots already. Water marks on the con=
tainer wall suggest ingress from above, not from our loading.

Invoice value of the 14 damaged pallets is EUR 8,200. Please register the cla=
im under CLM-2026-0912 and confirm the surveyor appointment. The goods are qu=
arantined in Rotterdam and we will not scrap anything before the survey. Phot=
os are shown below.

Best regards,
